# The build context for every image is `packages/`, because each service
# depends on the shomer-lib workspace package, which is not on PyPI and so
# has to be copied in beside it. Everything that is not source or
# packaging is excluded, or the context balloons and every image rebuild
# waits on it.
**/tests/
**/features/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
**/*.pyc
**/CHANGELOG.md
web/
cli/
